rhizo (0.1.6) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Requires the Rhizo kernel at revision 49, Linux 7.3.1, which forces
    lockdown in integrity mode, lets only init-namespace admin create
    SELinux namespaces, and seals a booted sandbox's pid namespace against
    further bpf(BPF_PROG_LOAD) (patch 0031).

